          "type": "Select",
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "b3ee9fac-9948-58f1-8117-8413c3b795a6",
              "text": "감이 올 때 한 번 더 밀어붙이자. 내가 봐 줄게.",
              "next": "4c9f27a6-a4b2-5a14-9c85-690ab2175cd8",
              "attrs": {
                "effects": "train_bonus:std;stress:+8;awaken:+5"
              },
              "i18n": {
                "En": {
                  "text": "Let's push once more while it clicks. I'll watch."
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "1307f70a-6f1e-5527-872f-66c3fc28f8b3",
              "text": "오늘은 여기까지. 푹 쉬면서 정리하자.",
              "next": "9a25359b-6883-5d9c-b6b1-37c72c93d338",
              "attrs": {
                "effects": "stress_train:-2;trust:+2"
              },
              "i18n": {
                "En": {
                  "text": "That's enough for today. Rest and let it settle."
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "0676d8cc-f1b5-5133-8879-06cc481b7107",
              "text": "잘했어. 그 감각 잊지 마.",
              "next": "51a492a3-ab4e-582a-9a62-c99c442554a4",
              "attrs": {
                "effects": "ok>trust:+3;ok>awaken:+8;ng>trust:+1"
              },
              "i18n": {
                "En": {
                  "text": "Good work. Don't lose that feeling."
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "4c9f27a6-a4b2-5a14-9c85-690ab2175cd8": {
          "localId": 6,
          "type": "Dialog",
          "speaker": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
          "lines": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "…좋아요, 한 번 더 해 볼게요!"
            }
          ],
          "i18n": {
            "En": {
              "lines": [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": "…Okay, one more go!"
